女は必死に「やめて」「放して」と懇願しています。", "nc": 168, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@taresudare72847/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3779822, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/41cbd6a4/uploads/origins/f57e2a7f-efcc-4097-be3e-3e4a30b20514?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c20952f23f557b9c0ce5f8fdabb96c3f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/41cbd6a4/uploads/origins/f57e2a7f-efcc-4097-be3e-3e4a30b20514?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c20952f23f557b9c0ce5f8fdabb96c3f, https://si.imgix.net/41cbd6a4/uploads/origins/f57e2a7f-efcc-4097-be3e-3e4a30b20514?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=15178fbc06167f819b29ddf98ccb11a9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/41cbd6a4/uploads/origins/f57e2a7f-efcc-4097-be3e-3e4a30b20514?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=451aef2705847595dcd3b9e6b36a8535 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/41cbd6a4/uploads/origins/f57e2a7f-efcc-4097-be3e-3e4a30b20514?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=90e1e093dd6af5a9853ffdc85d4a9f61", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/41cbd6a4/uploads/origins/f57e2a7f-efcc-4097-be3e-3e4a30b20514?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=90e1e093dd6af5a9853ffdc85d4a9f61, https://si.imgix.net/41cbd6a4/uploads/origins/f57e2a7f-efcc-4097-be3e-3e4a30b20514?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d16e7568dabfcf39c7f82bc8f666e086 2x, https://si.imgix.net/41cbd6a4/uploads/origins/f57e2a7f-efcc-4097-be3e-3e4a30b20514?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=70208955852af9108285aea57571694b 3x"}, "body": "リクエスト失礼いたします。\n東方Projectの矢田寺成美のくすぐりイラストをお願いいたします。\n\n・成美はビキニを着ている\n・成美はマジックハンドで万歳拘束されている\n・成美はマジックハンドで脇や脇腹などをくすぐられている\n\n何卒、ご検討のほどよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 169, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@taresudare72847/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3779822, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/94cd8dd0/uploads/origins/c79d66c3-c2ea-4678-a5b3-631f859bc6fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf74b851738f073072d6cb1751798542", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/94cd8dd0/uploads/origins/c79d66c3-c2ea-4678-a5b3-631f859bc6fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf74b851738f073072d6cb1751798542, https://si.imgix.net/94cd8dd0/uploads/origins/c79d66c3-c2ea-4678-a5b3-631f859bc6fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae068334ac89c04578fcab055f52a5ed 2x, https://si.imgix.net/94cd8dd0/uploads/origins/c79d66c3-c2ea-4678-a5b3-631f859bc6fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e28fd6dfd1f6a2e9d14f67e67bc0bc00 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/94cd8dd0/uploads/origins/c79d66c3-c2ea-4678-a5b3-631f859bc6fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6f16db707174a3a95fd83cecd437cc9f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/94cd8dd0/uploads/origins/c79d66c3-c2ea-4678-a5b3-631f859bc6fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6f16db707174a3a95fd83cecd437cc9f, https://si.imgix.net/94cd8dd0/uploads/origins/c79d66c3-c2ea-4678-a5b3-631f859bc6fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e7402c653a4d4fb85f9e5fbd830aeb56 2x, https://si.imgix.net/94cd8dd0/uploads/origins/c79d66c3-c2ea-4678-a5b3-631f859bc6fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d68edb69bb97766231d33fdf34badedf 3x"}, "body": "はじめまして！\n\nシチュエーション：\nサムライメイデンの玉織紬と伊夜がレズ集団に掴まれて下着の姿にされて足裏が見えるように拘束されてくすぐられて真っ赤顔して大爆笑している。\n\n玉織紬と伊夜の下着はセクシーな現代風でいいです。\n\n複数のモブ女の子たちが二人の全身をくすぐります。特に足裏、脇、乳房を重点的に。\n\n【差分希望】\n1. くすぐりの差分：羽根メインと手メインの2パターン\n2. 靴下の差分：靴下を履いたまま vs 靴下を脱がされて素足 の2パターン\n\n合計4パターン（羽根×靴下あり／なし、手×靴下あり／なし）でお願いします！\n\nキャラ参考資料：\n玉織紬：https://www.d3p.co.jp/s_maiden/assets/img/project/character/tsumugi/img00.png\n伊夜：\nhttps://www.d3p.co.jp/s_maiden/assets/img/project/character/iyo/img00.png", "nc": 48, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@taresudare72847/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bf4d89de/uploads/origins/c7796a62-9c79-4478-856c-72b249fe4373?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4d444a575349b0b6bf47d06e36817a00", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bf4d89de/uploads/origins/c7796a62-9c79-4478-856c-72b249fe4373?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4d444a575349b0b6bf47d06e36817a00, https://si.imgix.net/bf4d89de/uploads/origins/c7796a62-9c79-4478-856c-72b249fe4373?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f91bbd9a569b7746a64d831399d29606 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bf4d89de/uploads/origins/c7796a62-9c79-4478-856c-72b249fe4373?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b5cf4735490219a017ce5dc165f66a2d 3x"}, "private